    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Raster IRQ at line $5a, under the text rows of the score panel. It sets the first sprite row handler (patched). Then it switches to bitmap mode ($d011=$3b), sets the scene background colour and starts CIA2 timer B for the floor NMI."},
    {"at":5,"placement":"side","text":"Not a VIC IRQ: a CIA1 IRQ for the sample player"},
    {"at":14,"placement":"side","text":"Patched: raster line of the first row handler (first group_y + $14)"},
    {"at":19,"placement":"side","text":"Patched: first row handler, low byte"},
    {"at":24,"placement":"side","text":"Patched: first row handler, high byte"},
    {"at":29,"placement":"side","text":"Four NOPs: delay before the $d011 write"},
    {"at":33,"placement":"side","text":"Bitmap mode for the scene, from text row 5"},
    {"at":38,"placement":"side","text":"Patched at $1a6f/$1a7d: 1 white, 3 while a scene is drawn"},
    {"at":43,"placement":"side","text":"CIA2 timer B = $16bc (5820 cycles)"},
    {"at":53,"placement":"side","text":"Start timer B, one-shot: NMI at the floor"}
